Z||000000||NorthernFiero||10-23-2001||11:29 PM||||Where is the computer hook up in the 87 fiero?<P>Thanks<BR>Mike||||reg||5
Z||000001||grinthock||10-23-2001||11:51 PM||||See the glove box between the seats?  Behind it.  Against the fire wall, to access remove the bolts to remove the centre shifter console, then the glovebox console.  and voila!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Pontiaddict||10-23-2001||11:54 PM||||The connector is behind the plastic plate where the cigarette lighter is.<P>The computer is between the seats, hanging on the firewall, covered by the center console.||||reg||1
